  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kosovo: Green Energy Future, UNDP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project &#x201c;Inclusive and Just Pathway to 2030: Green Energy Transition&#x201d; supports Kosovo&#x2019;s decarbonization efforts through renewable energy adoption, energy efficiency, and inclusive economic growth. It addresses social inequalities by fostering local capacity and providing targeted support to vulnerable populations. The project contributes directly to SDG 7 and Denmark&#x2019;s green development cooperation goals.</narrative>
  </description>
